  "prompt": "A dynamic and mysterious futuristic Sichuan opera face-changing performance. At the center of the stage, a cyborg performer leaps into the air elegant yet powerful. His mechanical face splits and reconfigures, revealing streams of inner circuitry glowing beneath metal plates. He wears a white silk embroidered robe, swirling midair, detailed with red, green, and gold patterns that shimmer with digital luminescence. Across his face, a Sichuan opera mask in red, black, and white conveys a fierce theatrical energy. He raises his right hand a pink folding fan opens gracefully before a golden dragon-engraved backdrop. Warm amber light falls across the silk and chrome, blending the sacred and the futuristic. Then the lights dim suddenly He covers his face with the fan, and the mask instantly transforms into pink and gold. Another fade now cyan and blue shimmer across his features, as if his soul is changing frequencies. The white robe morphs into a black embroidered battle robe, and as it flutters through the air, molten golden sparks burst like forged fireworks, illuminating the stage with dreamlike, surreal brilliance. The entire scene is wrapped in mist and data-like light trails where the ancient spirit of theatre meets the pulse of a cybernetic future. Visual Style: cinematic HDR, ultra-detailed, merging oriental theatrical grandeur with cyber-fantasy aesthetics. Camera Direction: alternating medium and wide shots, slightly low angle; slow-motion focus on leaps, swirling robes, and the explosion of golden sparks. --ar 9:16 --raw --profile ok8gqmk --stylize 0",
